      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Tough race but CAPITOL HILL (5) looks ready to win. Has been going well, finishing a narrow second fresh then fourth over a mile at Darwin last time. Drops 3.5kg in the weights. Ready to win and looks hard to beat. VENTING (1) has to be a danger despite finishing at the tail last time. Won this two year go, then last year came off a Darwin Cup failure to place in this race. Again raced in the Darwin Cup this year and was safely held, but returns to Katherine in a far easier race and often turns the form around race to race. Expected to bounce back. HOTIM ENGLISH (6) was beaten must a head over further last time and is overdue for a win. Sure to prove tough to beat. BAROCCO BAR (8) was beaten comfortably last time out but this suits. THE GIRL'S BOY (3) is better than recent form suggests and worth including.",
